{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft &amp; Race!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft you race with freedom and creativity! Make your own vehicles, characters and tracks by combining simple shapes together without any restrictions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly configure your race as you want: the decorations, power-ups, moving obstacles and let's go!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to race? Go! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/126fdbc7bbe5e8abc482edf30d0a0860.poster.avif?t=1764385740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/126fdbc7bbe5e8abc482edf30d0a0860.webm?t=1764385740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/126fdbc7bbe5e8abc482edf30d0a0860.mp4?t=1764385740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform stunts, push, and rush to the finish line as fast as you can!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win tracks and models. Race as much as you want with endless fun!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race solo or up to 4 players!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/79822631a4894422d050833ea81228af.poster.avif?t=1764385740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/79822631a4894422d050833ea81228af.webm?t=1764385740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/79822631a4894422d050833ea81228af.mp4?t=1764385740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split Screen local multiplayer</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft animated racing tracks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/d0aab8f771f1ae77fd0cf2bccd6b5e26.poster.avif?t=1764385740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/d0aab8f771f1ae77fd0cf2bccd6b5e26.webm?t=1764385740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/d0aab8f771f1ae77fd0cf2bccd6b5e26.mp4?t=1764385740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit existing tracks or create new ones from scratch in any theme (cars, beach, bedroom, workshop, etc.)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add jumps, decorations, and obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use funny models as checkpoints and direction signs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft your animated characters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/dd8b4b0778f995be53e8866f0d3e1e9d.poster.avif?t=1764385740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/dd8b4b0778f995be53e8866f0d3e1e9d.webm?t=1764385740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/dd8b4b0778f995be53e8866f0d3e1e9d.mp4?t=1764385740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize any character or create your own. Bring any idea you can imagine to life, like a creature with a robot body and two animal heads. You choose!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft your animated Vehicles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/16e8e428f975b41a86257cbd762bf674.poster.avif?t=1764385740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/16e8e428f975b41a86257cbd762bf674.webm?t=1764385740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/16e8e428f975b41a86257cbd762bf674.mp4?t=1764385740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from classic options like karts, buggies, racing cars, and trucks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or go for funnier ones like a bath vehicle, a sofa car, or a tiger rover. Anything is possible!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft any mechanic you can imagine!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/4ddf482ac063978f23aca4efaf350521.poster.avif?t=1764385740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/4ddf482ac063978f23aca4efaf350521.webm?t=1764385740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/4ddf482ac063978f23aca4efaf350521.mp4?t=1764385740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animate rotations, movements, sizes, and even make objects spawn from others!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist 